    "label": "Visual acuity no light perception"
   },
   "description": "no light perception"
  },
  {
   "type": {
    "id": "HP:0012531",
    "label": "Pain"
   },
   "description": "excruciating pain"
  },
  {
   "type": {
    "id": "HP:0008046",
    "label": "Abnormal retinal vascular morphology"
   },
   "description": "dilated retinal vessels, mainly venules, primarily localised in the posterior pole"
  },
  {
   "type": {
    "id": "HP:0025016",
    "label": "Abnormal capillary morphology"
   },
   "description": "density of capillaries on the arteriolar side of the microcirculatory units was significantly decreased"
  },
  {
   "type": {
    "id": "HP:0007843",
    "label": "Attenuation of retinal blood vessels"
   },
   "description": "vascular system was seen to gradually attenuate towards the retinal periphery, and to stop at a zone located approximately 4 mm from the ora serrata along the whole circumference"
  },
  {
   "type": {
    "id": "HP:0007737",
    "label": "Spicular pigmentation of the retina"
   },
   "description": "pigmented aggregates characteristic of retinitis pigmentosa were seen to ensheath the retinal vessels"
  },
  {
   "type": {
    "id": "HP:0000546",
    "label": "Retinal degeneration"
   },
   "description": "photoreceptors were almost totally absent"
  },
  {
   "type": {
    "id": "HP:6001301",
    "label": "Retinal gliosis"
   },
   "description": "retinal gliosis was present"
  },
  {
   "type": {
    "id": "HP:0000587",
    "label": "Abnormal optic nerve morphology"
   },
   "description": "increased vacuolisation of the nerve fibre layer"
  }
